      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. i'm a bit worried about the \"security\" part. i don't have a huge IT team, so i'm mostly just using standard email and a basic website. what are some of the common ways data gets \"leaked\" or goes missing that i should be looking out for? i want to make sure nothing is happening behind the scenes that i'm not aware of.",
